  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">(6 fotos) The Learning Office, en la calle Concepci&oacute;n, 53 de Onda, ha acogido la tarde de este viernes una reuni&oacute;n sobre cursos de ingl&eacute;s en Irlanda, ofrecidos a trav&eacute;s de Yolo Experiences, para verano y todo el a&ntilde;o, tanto para adolescentes, adultos o familias. </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/11/IMG_1411.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Javier Burguete Ribes ha explicado los pormenores de estos cursos y todas las numerosas posibilidades que existen.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/thelearningofficecursosirlanda/img_1406.jpg\" alt=\"img_1406\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/thelearningofficecursosirlanda/img_1408.jpg\" alt=\"img_1408\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/thelearningofficecursosirlanda/img_1410.jpg\" alt=\"img_1410\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/thelearningofficecursosirlanda/img_1411.jpg\" alt=\"img_1411\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/thelearningofficecursosirlanda/img_1414.jpg\" alt=\"img_1414\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/thelearningofficecursosirlanda/yolo.jpg\" alt=\"yolo\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
